 "panels": [
  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "",
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "### Duplicate charges after a crash\n**Guide:** Failure modes: row 5  \u00b7  **Symptom:** Duplicate charges, emails or records.  \u00b7  **Cause:** Workflow task retry re-ran completed local activities.  \u00b7  **Fix:** Idempotency key per workflow ID and step; dedupe on the API side.\n\n**What to watch:** Duplicate side effects at the API after the first crash (no key); idempotent replays instead after the second crash (key).\n\n| # | Variant | Phase | Length | What changes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | broken | crash without idempotency keys | 75 s |  |\n| 2 | fixed | crash with idempotency keys | 75 s |  |\n\nRun it from the [control page](http://localhost:8088). Blue regions mark phases; red markers are crashes and restarts."
   },
   "id": 1,
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 7
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "state-timeline",
   "title": "Phase",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "demo_scenario_variant{scenario=\"duplicates\"}",
     "legendFormat": "{{scenario}}",
     "range": true,
     "instant": false,
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "refId": "A"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "color": {
      "mode": "thresholds"
     },
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "#8E8E8E",
        "value": null
       }
      ]
     },
     "mappings": [
      {
       "type": "value",
       "options": {
        "0": {
         "text": "idle",
         "color": "#8E8E8E",
         "index": 0
        },
        "1": {
         "text": "baseline",
         "color": "#3274D9",
         "index": 1
        },
        "2": {
         "text": "broken",
         "color": "#E02F44",
         "index": 2
        },
        "3": {
         "text": "fixed",
         "color": "#56A64B",
         "index": 3
        }
       }
      }
     ],
     "custom": {
      "fillOpacity": 80,
      "lineWidth": 0
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "showValue": "auto",
    "mergeValues": true,
    "rowHeight": 0.8,
    "alignValue": "left",
    "legend": {
     "showLegend": false
    },
    "tooltip": {
     "mode": "single"
    }
   },
   "id": 2,
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 7,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "Re-executed calls at the API (per minute)",
   "description": "A duplicate is a second charge/email for the same order and step. A replay is the same re-execution answered from the idempotency store.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "sum by (step) (increase(api_duplicate_side_effects_total[1m]))",
     "legendFormat": "DUPLICATE side effect \u00b7 {{step}}",
     "range": true,
     "instant": false,
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "refId": "A"
    },
    {
     "expr": "sum by (step) (increase(api_idempotent_replays_total[1m]))",
     "legendFormat": "idempotent replay \u00b7 {{step}}",
     "range": true,
     "instant": false,
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "refId": "B"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short",
     "custom": {
      "drawStyle": "bars",
      "lineWidth": 2,
      "fillOpacity": 70,
      "showPoints": "never",
      "spanNulls": true,
      "stacking": {
       "mode": "normal",
       "group": "A"
      },
      "axisSoftMin": 0,
      "lineInterpolation": "linear"
     },
     "color": {
      "mode": "palette-classic"
     }
    },
    "overrides": [
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byRegexp",
       "options": "DUPLICATE.*"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "color",
        "value": {
         "mode": "fixed",
         "fixedColor": "#E02F44"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byRegexp",
       "options": "idempotent.*"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "color",
        "value": {
         "mode": "fixed",
         "fixedColor": "#56A64B"
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "options": {
    "legend": {
     "displayMode": "list",
     "placement": "bottom",
     "showLegend": true
    },
    "tooltip": {
     "mode": "multi",
     "sort": "desc"
    }
   },
   "id": 3,
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 10,
